   "tex": "I_{1N}=\\frac{S_N}{U_{1N}}=\\frac{1000}{60}=16.67\\ \\mathrm{A},\\qquad\n   I_{2N}=\\frac{S_N}{U_{2N}}=\\frac{1000}{6.3}=158.7\\ \\mathrm{A},\\qquad k=\\frac{60}{6.3}=9.52",
